  m_text: "<color=#5E200C><b>How long does it take to withdraw money?</b></color>\r\n<color=#5E200C>\rGenerally,
    funds will be credited to your account within a few minutes. If the number of
    withdrawals or the withdrawal amount exceeds a certain limit, the system will
    review it. In this case, the funds will still be credited within <color=#C9785D><b>24
    hours</b></color>, so please don\u2019t worry.\r</color>\r"
